 green  inferior   yellow  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 6cm hemorrhagic cavity  surrounded by yellow  gritty discoloration  consistent with fat necrosis  The cavity is located 0 4cm from the lateral margin  1 5cm from the medial margin  0 3cm from the superior margin  0 5cm from the posterior margin  0 4cm from the anterior margin  and 0 6cm from the inferior margin  The remaining cut surfaces consist predominantly of hemorrhagic fibrous tissue  with a small amount of interspersed yellow  lobulated adipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  radially sectioned   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of biopsy cavity  sequentially from lateral to medial   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section away from biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin  en face  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1   RIGHT SENTINEL LYMPH NODE   NO DEFINITIVE CARCINOMA IDENTIFIED  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  Lymph Node  Right Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART B  Breast  Right   Excision PART C  Cryostat Frozen Section  slide only   report_end  , Not_reported.
