om the lateral margin  1 5cm from the medial margin  0 2cm from the anterior margin  and abuts the superior margin at the most anterior aspect of the white area  There is also a hemorrhagic punctate area corresponding to the needle tract  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm that is located 2 1cm from the lateral margin  1 5cm from the closest medial margin  0 2cm from the closest superior margin  and 0 23cm from the closest inferior margin  The specimen is submitted in entirety from posterior to anterior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections representing the lesion near the localization wire correspond to  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  are parts of the same tissue section    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  contains the posterior margin radially sectioned   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  contains the anterior margin submitted en face  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast final shaved margins   are three fragmented  unoriented fragments of breast tissue  measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Abner Louissaint M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Abner Louissaint M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Abner Louissaint M D   Ph D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Christine Garcia M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION , Not_reported.
